BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Primal Fear 2026
DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20260925T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20261031T180000
DTSTAMP:20260831T153732Z
UID:gz-primal-fear-2026-1878024@southbaldwinchamber.com
DESCRIPTION:Description\nThis Halloween season\, step into Primal Fear\, O
 WA's most terrifying immersive attraction\, where your deepest fears becom
 e your reality. Open select nights September 25–26 and October 2–3\, 9
 –10\, 16–17\, and 22–31\, 2026\, Primal Fear takes guests on a psych
 ological journey through a maze designed to awaken humanity's most instinc
 tive fears. From claustrophobic passageways and unsettling distortions to 
 the chilling sensation of being watched or hunted\, every room is crafted 
 to keep you questioning what waits around the next corner. As the darkness
  closes in\, you'll quickly discover that the greatest terror isn't what y
 ou can see—it's what your mind creates. Every sound\, shadow\, and unexp
 ected encounter is designed to blur the line between imagination and reali
 ty\, delivering an experience that lingers long after you've escaped. Look
 ing for an even greater challenge? Upgrade your experience with exclusive 
 add-ons\, including the Black-Out Hour\, where the lights go out\, scare a
 ctors move to new locations\, and your only guide through the darkness is 
 a small flashlight. Complete your night with limited-time themed food and 
 beverages\, exclusive Primal Fear merchandise\, and unforgettable memories
 —if you make it out. You don’t find your fears. Your fears find you.\n
 \n---\n🌐 View original event: https://businesshub.southbaldwinchamber.c
 om/calendar/Details/primal-fear-2026-1878024
LOCATION:downton owa
END:VEVENT
