 Trick Contest\n1 PM: Dock Diving\n2 PM: Seattle Fetch\n3 PM: Hamburger Eat
 ing Contest\nWe’ll also have live music from W.B. Sims while we raise mo
 ney and support a great cause with Future Homes Animal Rescue and Wags & W
 hiskers. Start training\, tell your dog-loving friends\, and mark October 
