UID:gz-white-tie-rock-ensemble-presents-a-night-of-southern-rock-legends-1
 878466@southbaldwinchamber.com
DESCRIPTION:Description\nGet ready for an unforgettable night of symphonic
  rock as The White Tie Rock Ensemble returns to OWA Theater for two perfor
 mances on August 14 & 15\, 2026\, at 7:00 p.m. After previous appearances 
 at OWA\, the acclaimed ensemble is back with an all-new production\, deliv
 ering this spectacular show to OWA audiences for the very first time. Comb
 ining the precision of a symphony orchestra with the energy of classic roc
